  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the orthocentre of the triangle whose vertices are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msubsup><mi>xsin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi></math> , then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
